From d827f97880246ccea177717cdfc9fba3866d447e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Hades <15710513+hadesdevls@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 08:55:31 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] windowing/gbm: whether the pass 7 mask was asked for is of
 the frame that asked

m_packerTried says that the pass 7 mask of the packer was asked for, or came, in
this frame, so that HdrTilesUpdate() does not make the mask of the GUI texture
for a Dolby Vision frame that has one. It was set only by DVTilesUpdate(), which
the frames of HDR over the tunnel never call: the value that a DV video left
stayed, and the tunnel's composite over a reused GUI was the whole quad, never
under the scissor rectangles of the GUI's mask, for as long as it played.

It is false at the start of every frame (BeginGuiComposite()), which includes the
first of each video and of each native output, and only the picture of the frame
sets it. A DV frame decides as before.

Host test (outside the tree): packer_tried_test.py (a model of the request over
a DV frame and frames of the tunnel; the wiring in the tree and two mutants of it,
each caught). Before this change the wiring fails.
---
 xbmc/windowing/gbm/WinSystemGbmGLESContext.cpp | 3 +++
 xbmc/windowing/gbm/WinSystemGbmGLESContext.h   | 3 ++-
 2 files changed, 5 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/xbmc/windowing/gbm/WinSystemGbmGLESContext.cpp b/xbmc/windowing/gbm/WinSystemGbmGLESContext.cpp
index 55cb753..8efbe32 100644
--- a/xbmc/windowing/gbm/WinSystemGbmGLESContext.cpp
+++ b/xbmc/windowing/gbm/WinSystemGbmGLESContext.cpp
@@ -1988,6 +1988,9 @@ bool CWinSystemGbmGLESContext::BeginGuiComposite(bool guiWillRender)
   DVMenusUpdate();
 #endif
   m_guiBackDrawn = false; // (Hades: EndGuiComposite())
+  // (Hades: the pass 7 mask of this frame is asked for by its picture, DVTilesUpdate(): what a
+  // frame before asked says nothing of this one, of HDR over the tunnel or of another video)
+  m_packerTried = false;
   if (!m_guiCompositing)
     return false;
 
diff --git a/xbmc/windowing/gbm/WinSystemGbmGLESContext.h b/xbmc/windowing/gbm/WinSystemGbmGLESContext.h
index 6bbfc59..1fd656c 100644
--- a/xbmc/windowing/gbm/WinSystemGbmGLESContext.h
+++ b/xbmc/windowing/gbm/WinSystemGbmGLESContext.h
@@ -512,7 +512,8 @@ private:
   static constexpr int TILES_GUI_DV = 2;
   static constexpr int TILES_GUI_HDR = 3;
   int m_tilesKind{0};
-  //! ... this frame's pass 7 mask was asked for, or came (the GUI texture's is not made then)
+  //! ... this frame's pass 7 mask was asked for, or came (the GUI texture's is not made then);
+  //! false at the start of every frame (BeginGuiComposite())
   bool m_packerTried{false};
   //! ... the mask of the GUI texture that waits is for the Dolby Vision composite
   bool m_hdrMaskDv{false};
